    "\n",
    "### Relation to Our Work\n",
    "\n",
    "The paper mainly provides a baseline for maze pathfinding, while our work focuses on the additional problem of **partial observation and dynamic replanning**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Our navigation design extends basic pathfinding by allowing the robot to:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Discover the maze progressively.\n",
    "2. Maintain a discovered map.\n",
