    "- Start position: (0, 0)\n",
    "- Goal position: (9, 9)\n",
    "- Observation model: Four neighbouring cells\n",
    "- Planning algorithm: A*\n",
    "- Navigation strategy: Reactive A*\n",
    "- Ground-truth map contains hidden obstacles\n",
    "- Robot initially does not know all obstacles\n",
    "\n",
